Subject: [PATCH 16/53] B70-IP-W4A8: W4A8 routed experts for the XPU int4 MoE
 (B70_MOE_W4A8=1)

int4 g128 weights read as XpuFusedMoe stores them (no copy, no repack), int8
per-token dynamic activations, int4->int8 unpack in registers, int8 x int8 ->
int32 DPAS per 128-group with the group scale applied to the int32 partial.
Stock remap_hidden_states (int8 bytes routed as e4m3) and moe_gather; SiLU*up
fused into the gemm2 activation quantizer. Wired in XPUExperts.apply and the
hot/cold hot + staged-cold impls for batches >= B70_MOE_W4A8_MIN_TOKENS (64);
cold experts over UVA only with B70_MOE_W4A8_UVA=1. CPU tests (interpreter).
